{
  "job_B2.2.10_20251003_114500": {
    "text": "Eala, gefyrn is \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0urh deofol fela \u00feinga misfor, & \u00fe\u00e6t mancynn to swy\u00f0e Gode mishyrde, & \u00fe\u00e6t\nNe r\u00e6de we \u00feeah ahwar on bocum \u00fe\u00e6t man ar\u00e6rde \u00e6nig h\u00e6\u00f0engyld ahwar on worulde on eallum \u00feam\nAc sy\u00f0\u00f0an \u00fe\u00e6t gewear\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t Nembro\u00f0 & \u00f0a entas worhton \u00feone wundorlican stypel \u00e6fter Noes flode, &\n\u00dea sy\u00f0\u00f0an toferdon hy wide landes, & mancyn \u00fea sona swy\u00f0e weox.\n& \u00f0a \u00e6t nyhstan wurdon hi bep\u00e6hte \u00feurh \u00f0one ealdan deofol \u00fee Adam iu \u00e6r beswac swa \u00fe\u00e6t hi\nHi namon eac him \u00f0a \u00fe\u00e6t to wisdome \u00feurh deofles lare \u00fe\u00e6t hy wur\u00f0edon him for godas \u00fea sunnan &\nSume men eac s\u00e6dan be \u00f0am scinendum steorrum \u00fe\u00e6t hi godas w\u00e6ron, & agunnan hy weor\u00f0ian\nAc hy mihton georne tocnawan, gif hi cu\u00f0on \u00fe\u00e6t gescead, \u00fe\u00e6t se is so\u00f0 God \u00fee ealle \u00feas \u00f0ing gescop us\n\u00d0as gesceafta eac ealle do\u00f0 swa swa him gedihte heora agen scyppend & ne magon nan \u00feing don butan\nGyt \u00f0a h\u00e6\u00feenan noldon beon gehealdene on swa feawum godum swa hy \u00e6r h\u00e6fdan, ac fengon to\nAn man w\u00e6s on geardagum eardiende on \u00feam iglande \u00fee Creta hatte se w\u00e6s Saturnus gehaten, & se\nHe l\u00e6fde swa\u00feeah unea\u00f0e \u00e6nne to life, \u00feeah \u00f0e he fordyde \u00fea bro\u00f0ra elles; & se w\u00e6s Iouis gehaten, &\nHe aflymde his agene f\u00e6der eft of \u00f0am ylcan fores\u00e6dan iglande \u00fee Creta hatte & wolde hine forfaran\n& se Iouis wear\u00f0 swa swy\u00f0e gal \u00fe\u00e6t he on his agenre swyster gewifode, seo w\u00e6s genamod Iuno, & heo\nHeora twa dohtra w\u00e6ron Minerua & Uenus.\n\u00deas manfullan men \u00fee we ymbe speca\u00f0 w\u00e6ron getealde for \u00f0a m\u00e6rostan godas \u00fea on \u00f0am dagum, & \u00fea\nAc se sunu w\u00e6s swa\u00feeah swy\u00f0or on h\u00e6\u00f0enscype gewur\u00f0od \u00feonne se f\u00e6der w\u00e6re, & he is geteald eac\nAnd he hatte \u00feor o\u00f0rum naman betwux sumum \u00feeodum; \u00f0one Denisca leoda lufia\u00f0 swy\u00f0ost & on heora\nHis sunu hatte Mars, se macode \u00e6fre gewinn & wrohte, & saca & wraca he styrede gelome.\n\u00d0ysne yrming \u00e6fter his for\u00f0si\u00f0e wur\u00f0odon \u00fea h\u00e6\u00f0enan eac for healicne god, & swa oft swa hy\n& hy gelyfdon \u00fe\u00e6t he miclum mihte heom fultumian on gefeohte for\u00f0an \u00fee he gefeoht & gewinn lufude\nSum man eac w\u00e6s gehaten Mercurius on life, se w\u00e6s swy\u00f0e facenfull & \u00f0eah full snotorwyrde swicol\n\u00d0one macedon \u00fea h\u00e6\u00f0enan be heora get\u00e6le eac heom to m\u00e6ran gode, & \u00e6t wega gel\u00e6tum him lac\n\u00d0es gedwolgod w\u00e6s arwur\u00f0e eac betwux eallum h\u00e6\u00f0enum on \u00feam dagum, & he is O\u00f0on gehaten\nNu secga\u00f0 sume \u00fea Denisce men on heora gedwylde \u00fe\u00e6t se Iouis w\u00e6re \u00fee hy \u00feor hata\u00f0, Mercuries\nAnd sum wif hatte Uenus seo w\u00e6s Ioues dohtor, & seo w\u00e6s swa ful & swa fracod on galnysse \u00fe\u00e6t hyre\nManege eac o\u00f0re h\u00e6\u00feene godas w\u00e6ron mistlice fundene & eac swylce h\u00e6\u00feene gydena on swy\u00f0licum\nAnd se syrwienda deofol \u00fee a swica\u00f0 embe mancyn gebrohte \u00fea h\u00e6\u00f0enan men on \u00feam healicon\nAc se bi\u00f0 ges\u00e6lig \u00fee eal swylc oferhoga\u00f0 & \u00f0one so\u00f0an Godd lufa\u00f0 & weor\u00f0a\u00f0 \u00fee ealle \u00feing gescop &\nAn is \u00e6lmihtig God on \u00ferym hadum, \u00fe\u00e6t is f\u00e6der & suna & halig gast.\nEalle \u00fea \u00f0ry naman befeh\u00f0 an godcund miht & is an ece God, waldend & wyrhta ealra gesceafta.\nHim symle sy lof & weor\u00f0mynt in ealra worulda woruld a butan ende, amen.",
    "embedding": [
